  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to universal access of DRC population to effective and impactful interventions against malaria - Congo (Democratic Republic) (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Congo (Democratic Republic), Malaria, Ministry of Public Health, Hygiene and Social Security (MOH DRC)This program has the following goals: Contribuer &#xe0; l&#x2019;&#xe9;limination du paludisme en R&#xe9;publique D&#xe9;mocratique du Congo et, de ce fait, am&#xe9;liorer l&#x2019;&#xe9;tat de sant&#xe9; de la population g&#xe9;n&#xe9;rale par la r&#xe9;duction de la charge humaine et socio-&#xe9;conomique due au paludisme / To contribute to the elimination of malaria in the Democratic Republic of Congo and thereby improve the health status of the general population by reducing the human and socio-economic burden due to malaria.. The objectives of this program are: &#xa0;R&#xe9;duire l&#x2019;incidence du paludisme dans le pays par rapport &#xe0; la situation de 2021 au moins de 50% d&#x2019;ici 2028 /  Reduce the incidence of malaria in the country from the 2021 situation by at least 50% by 2028.  R&#xe9;duire les taux de mortalit&#xe9; li&#xe9;e au paludisme par rapport &#xe0; la situation de 2021 au moins 70% d&#x2019;ici 2028 / Reduce malaria mortality rates from 2021 levels by at least 70% by 2028</narrative>
  </description>
